      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KOJAK (2) unlucky not to get off the mark with a narrow second at Wellington two back, then covered plenty of ground in the run with a dismal eleventh over 1400m at Dubbo. Beautifully placed from the good gate and can get the job done today. GREY BELIEF (7) savaged the line when she jumped in trip for a narrow third over this trip in a C1 at Coonamble. Will go back from the sticky gate and expected to go close. FARCOLO (6) big drop in class fourth up after she failed to close off when sixth over 1500m at Hawkesbury. No excuses from the rails draw and has to show something today. MR CROWNING MOMENT (8) two runs back have had merit and gets map favours with the claim. Snagged back from the draw and chipped away late when fifth over 1600m at Cootamundra. Can figure in the minor money.",
